# KDE Plasma 6 (X11 session) for the CI rootfs, installed by tools/ci/rootfs.sh with apt-get --no-install-recommends
# in the chroot (debootstrap's resolver cannot handle Plasma's alternatives). Owned by the GPU/Plasma work (branch
# claude/desktop-gpu, REPORT.md there); XFCE in rootfs-debian.list stays the light fallback.
# No Papirus (130k icon files: slow to unpack on NTFS); the theme, wallpaper and session script come from
# desktop/build-overlay.sh, OpenGL on D3D12 from desktop/gpu/build-mesa.sh (/opt/xrl-gpu).
# The session: plasma-workspace (startplasma-x11, plasmashell, ksmserver), the desktop shell and its KCMs, KWin on X11.
plasma-workspace plasma-desktop kwin-x11 plasma-integration kde-cli-tools
# Look: Breeze (Qt style, window decoration, cursors, GTK theme), the icon theme, Inter + JetBrains Mono fonts.
breeze breeze-cursor-theme breeze-gtk-theme kf6-breeze-icon-theme kde-config-gtk-style fonts-inter fonts-jetbrains-mono fonts-noto-color-emoji
# Apps: terminal, file manager, settings, the launcher's search.
konsole dolphin systemsettings milou
# OpenGL checks (glxinfo, glxgears, eglinfo), window tools for the session script, libxcb-composite for xrl-cow-id.
mesa-utils xdotool libxcb-composite0
# Vulkan (Dozen in /opt/xrl-gpu): the loader, vulkaninfo and vkcube.
libvulkan1 vulkan-tools
# Video decode checks (VA-API through /opt/xrl-gpu): vainfo, ffmpeg (also makes the test clips).
vainfo ffmpeg
